Spec: Authenticated Android application boundary

Purpose:
  Expose scoped declarations, local permission requests and private business descriptors to independent applications.

Owns:
  ./ControlService.java

Must:
  Capture actual UID, profile and signing/install scope on the Binder thread with nonblocking caller/global quota.
  Preserve strict envelope, original manifest size and exact parameter validation and return fixed errors without raw exceptions.
  Expose no owner approval, identity import, route mutation or gateway-stop RPC.
  Require owner-started runtime for business opens and bind descriptor attachments to the same actual caller.

  Advertise experimental relay only with an owner-configured running provider; preserve recorded paths even while stopped.
  Dispatch formal operations with original params bytes, expose caller-filtered durable statuses and append one-use stream-reference Binder attachment.
  Keep formal capability experimental and require configured server authority for new business opens; history remains queryable while stopped without claiming an inactive stream is live.
